        {
          "id": 443141819,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "In this specific case the TFS was populating the global namespace already (it was not added as a static in the source file), so it somewhat made sense to make its implementation complete. For the others you've mentioned, as long as they're static there's no real need.",
